message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
title: "Same Magnetic Danger, Different Outcome"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Lokesh
    family-names: Chaudhary
  - given-names: Kyros
    family-names: Goyal
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen models, pre-registrations and result logs for a study of solar-flare false alarms:
  among alarms with matched magnetic-model scores, is AIA 94 Å variability (CV_box) in the 24 hours
  before the alarm higher for true alarms than for false alarms?
keywords:
  - solar flares
  - flare forecasting
  - SDO/AIA
  - SHARP
  - pre-registration
